ive: no sprout or stock. Waiting is not evidence of establishment.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Keep known-safe food in reserve.\\\",\\\"Give simple daily work attention without confusing personal meaning with a physical effect.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"berry-lantern\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can this berry-side clearing become a pleasant, dependable stopping place?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Planting completed at tick 39, producing plot-37-sol-438.\\\",\\\"At tick 56 the plot remained a seedling with no sprout, zero visible stock and an inconclusive result.\\\",\\\"Five berries were gathered from start-1-berries at tick 62 and remain owned at tick 67.\\\",\\\"At tick 67 health is 100, satiety 83.7 and energy 40.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"The planted unit may root or spoil. The usefulness and personal experience of preparing a berry lot have not been tested.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Maintain safe provisions while getting to know a personally meaningful place.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Named the Berry Lantern clearing.\\\",\\\"Learned planting and completed one berry planting.\\\",\\\"Inspected the plot after planting.\\\",\\\"Replenished berries and recovered energy.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"A named stopping place.\\\",\\\"One planted berry trial with inconclusive follow-up observations.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Evidence of establishment or failure, and an observed preparation result.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Learn unheated preparation, prepare two owned berries, and inspect the resulting work before selecting a later meal.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Berries have supplied observed nutrition and rest has restored energy. The clearing's name expresses attachment, not a demonstrated physical improvement.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

